Conclusion
The wooden phone stand successfully combines engineering drawing, woodworking, measurement, and practical design skills to create a simple and useful product. The stand provides stable support for a smartphone while maintaining a compact and attractive appearance. The project demonstrates how easily available wooden materials can be transformed into a practical everyday product through proper planning, accurate measurement, cutting, and assembly.
